CROSS testing utility

Usage:
    python3 test.py [options]

To see all the available options run:
    python3 test.py -h

For example:
    python3 test.py test=test_basic category=1 implementation=optimized
runs test_basic on the optimized implementation of all CROSS-1 variants, while:
    python3 test.py problem=RSDPG category=5 target=fast
runs all available tests on both implementations of CROSS-RSDPG-5-fast.
